  "purpose": "Machine-readable whole-system architecture map separating semantic ownership hierarchy from interaction/runtime relationships. It preserves canonical semantic owners, prevents implementation-host promotion to authority, and models explicit projection/event/contract flows without making TAKY or any app the owner of all meaning.",
