    "TAKY_CORE governs flow, evidence, routing and validation; it is not the semantic owner of every domain.",
    "OWNERSHIP_HIERARCHY != INTERACTION_GRAPH.",
    "IMPLEMENTED_IN != OWNS.",
    "HOSTED_BY != SEMANTIC_OWNER.",
    "RUNTIME_COORDINATOR != SEMANTIC_OWNER.",
    "UI_HOST != SEMANTIC_OWNER.",
    "ROUTES_TO != OWNS.",
    "APP != OS.",
    "APP_REPOSITORY != DOMAIN_AUTHORITY.",
    "WORK_OS and LEARNING_OS are sibling operating systems under TAKY; neither is the parent of the other.",
    "SHARED_TECHNICAL_CAPABILITY is semantic-light and may share mechanisms, not domain identity/role/permission/authority by default.",
    "SHARED_ENGINE != SHARED_DATA != SHARED_SEMANTICS != SHARED_AUTHORITY.",
    "SAME_PERSON != SAME_DOMAIN_IDENTITY.",
    "ACCOUNT_LINK != AUTHORITY_LINK.",
    "LEARNING_ENGINE INTERPRETS; PLANNER_ENGINE MANAGES; EXECUTION_APPS EXECUTE.",
    "Apps consume versioned projections/contracts and return events/evidence; they SHALL NOT directly mutate another owner's semantic state.",
    "SUMMARY != AUTHORITY.",
    "SEARCH_MISS != SOURCE_ABSENCE.",
    "NO_DELTA_EVIDENCE -> NO_REWRITE_OF_SETTLED_DECISION."
